# Nothing OS Design System — Cursor Rules

## Project Overview
- React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4.2.2
- Nothing-inspired design: black/white/red only, Doto font for metrics
- 52 widgets in `src/design/widgets/`
- Desktop = floating windows / Mobile = stacked cards

## Coding Rules
- Use Tailwind container queries (`@min-[300px]:`) NOT screen queries (`md:`)
- Widget codes follow format: `ABCDE-000`
- Keep layout, primitives, and widget logic separated
- Reuse tokens from `src/design/tokens/` and primitives from `src/design/primitives/`
- Never use gradients or decorative shadows unless requested
- Black/white first; red only for status/alert/active emphasis

## Widget Development
- All new widgets must use `Tile` primitive with `nothing-card` class
- Base font size for metrics: 24-32px, scale with `@min-[300px]` / `@min-[360px]`
- Widgets must be responsive to their container width, not viewport
- Add new widgets to `src/pages/NothingPlaygroundPage.tsx`
- Register widgets in `src/components/WidgetRegistry.tsx`

## File Structure
```
src/design/tokens/      — CSS variables
src/design/primitives/  — Tile, Label, DotText, etc.
src/design/widgets/     — 52 widget components
src/components/         — Desktop, Window, Taskbar, AppLauncher
src/context/            — AuthProvider, WidgetSettingsContext
```

## Tech Stack
- React 19, TypeScript strict
- Tailwind v4 with `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin
- Lucide icons only
- No external UI libraries

## Verification
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build` before committing
- Keep desktop and mobile behavior stable
